Package: dockstation-gateway
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: DockStation Project
Depends: @RUNTIME_DEPENDS@, adduser, systemd
Description: DockStation read-only Linux Gateway
 C++ Gateway service and local diagnostic API for DockStation Repka stations.
 This package does not configure physical UART/GPIO or flash ESP32 firmware.
